{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Game Discussion &amp; Bug Reports</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/c584a32176505665eed1225b90139e60.avif?t=1772811309\" width=1080 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Herb Tea King</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Herb Tea King</i> is a simulation-adventure game set in 1990s Guangdong (Lingnan region, including Hong Kong and Macau).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Sung</strong>, a chubby young man from Northern China who travels south to work at a long-established herbal tea shop. As Sung, you\u2019ll assist your master in brewing herbal tea, preparing medicinal ingredients, serving customers, and navigating the lively neighborhood streets \u2014 solving humorous incidents caused by traditional Chinese medicine symptoms such as \u201cinternal heat\u201d or \u201cexcess dampness.\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven experience focused on story progression and light environmental puzzle interaction, complemented by light simulation and management elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While working at the herbal tea shop, you\u2019ll meet four mischievous little spirits representing <strong>Dampness, Heat, Cold, and Toxin</strong>, and gradually uncover the hidden past of your master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each bowl of herbal tea you brew may unfold a warm \u2014 and sometimes mysterious \u2014 Lingnan street legend.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/6a0a3af274f7e4f183dfe0352bedb687.poster.avif?t=1772811309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/6a0a3af274f7e4f183dfe0352bedb687.webm?t=1772811309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/6a0a3af274f7e4f183dfe0352bedb687.mp4?t=1772811309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn Traditional Chinese Herbs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiarize yourself with authentic Chinese medicinal herbs such as <strong>chrysanthemum, honeysuckle, licorice root</strong>, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on customers\u2019 symptoms (Dampness, Heat, Cold, and Toxin attributes), you\u2019ll combine the correct herbal properties to create the perfect herbal tea formula.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/9eb1098e5d1f942a77dfa4ca9f345a4f.avif?t=1772811309\" width=1080 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GUANGDONG Architecture &amp; Neighborhood Stories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Herb Tea King</i> features around <strong>50 NPCs</strong>, each designed with distinctive 1990s Lingnan characteristics. Most characters have their own short, heartwarming, or humorous side stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/5d34fa7d83f7156946fb1e0b9dd4ae9b.avif?t=1772811309\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras_big/5d34fa7d83f7156946fb1e0b9dd4ae9b.webp?t=1772811309 width=1560 height=357 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a wide variety of hand-drawn indoor and outdoor environments inspired by 1990s Guangdong, Hong Kong, and Macau architecture \u2014 crafted to evoke a shared sense of nostalgia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/0e22f3e6cfe310e6e835c6790968dc6f.poster.avif?t=1772811309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/0e22f3e6cfe310e6e835c6790968dc6f.webm?t=1772811309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/0e22f3e6cfe310e6e835c6790968dc6f.mp4?t=1772811309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Drawn Frame-by-Frame Animation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple hand-drawn, frame-by-frame cutscenes. Watching these small animated moments can be a relaxing experience on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/f4ef33c227a44c3a243c45b133975cc8.poster.avif?t=1772811309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/f4ef33c227a44c3a243c45b133975cc8.webm?t=1772811309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/f4ef33c227a44c3a243c45b133975cc8.mp4?t=1772811309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city, everyone is busy chasing a living.<br>The herbal tea shop may be just a small corner on the street \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the tea you brew might be what allows someone to slow down, and finally catch their breath.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703200?t=1772811309","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703200?t=1772811309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/b3019b73f2c999bb19b4611c11b0c48493be40d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772811309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/b3019b73f2c999bb19b4611c11b0c48493be40d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772811309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4241120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Game Discussion &amp; Bug Reports</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/c584a32176505665eed1225b90139e60.avif?t=1772811309\" width=1080 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Herb Tea King</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Herb Tea King</i> is a simulation-adventure game set in 1990s Guangdong (Lingnan region, including Hong Kong and Macau).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Sung</strong>, a chubby young man from Northern China who travels south to work at a long-established herbal tea shop. As Sung, you\u2019ll assist your master in brewing herbal tea, preparing medicinal ingredients, serving customers, and navigating the lively neighborhood streets \u2014 solving humorous incidents caused by traditional Chinese medicine symptoms such as \u201cinternal heat\u201d or \u201cexcess dampness.\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven experience focused on story progression and light environmental puzzle interaction, complemented by light simulation and management elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While working at the herbal tea shop, you\u2019ll meet four mischievous little spirits representing <strong>Dampness, Heat, Cold, and Toxin</strong>, and gradually uncover the hidden past of your master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each bowl of herbal tea you brew may unfold a warm \u2014 and sometimes mysterious \u2014 Lingnan street legend.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/6a0a3af274f7e4f183dfe0352bedb687.poster.avif?t=1772811309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/6a0a3af274f7e4f183dfe0352bedb687.webm?t=1772811309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/6a0a3af274f7e4f183dfe0352bedb687.mp4?t=1772811309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn Traditional Chinese Herbs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiarize yourself with authentic Chinese medicinal herbs such as <strong>chrysanthemum, honeysuckle, licorice root</strong>, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on customers\u2019 symptoms (Dampness, Heat, Cold, and Toxin attributes), you\u2019ll combine the correct herbal properties to create the perfect herbal tea formula.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/9eb1098e5d1f942a77dfa4ca9f345a4f.avif?t=1772811309\" width=1080 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GUANGDONG Architecture &amp; Neighborhood Stories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Herb Tea King</i> features around <strong>50 NPCs</strong>, each designed with distinctive 1990s Lingnan characteristics. Most characters have their own short, heartwarming, or humorous side stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/5d34fa7d83f7156946fb1e0b9dd4ae9b.avif?t=1772811309\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras_big/5d34fa7d83f7156946fb1e0b9dd4ae9b.webp?t=1772811309 width=1560 height=357 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a wide variety of hand-drawn indoor and outdoor environments inspired by 1990s Guangdong, Hong Kong, and Macau architecture \u2014 crafted to evoke a shared sense of nostalgia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/0e22f3e6cfe310e6e835c6790968dc6f.poster.avif?t=1772811309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/0e22f3e6cfe310e6e835c6790968dc6f.webm?t=1772811309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/0e22f3e6cfe310e6e835c6790968dc6f.mp4?t=1772811309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Drawn Frame-by-Frame Animation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple hand-drawn, frame-by-frame cutscenes. Watching these small animated moments can be a relaxing experience on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/f4ef33c227a44c3a243c45b133975cc8.poster.avif?t=1772811309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/f4ef33c227a44c3a243c45b133975cc8.webm?t=1772811309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/extras/f4ef33c227a44c3a243c45b133975cc8.mp4?t=1772811309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city, everyone is busy chasing a living.<br>The herbal tea shop may be just a small corner on the street \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the tea you brew might be what allows someone to slow down, and finally catch their breath.</p>","developers":["Cateasee Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703200/84e784f2346743b7b3025c8daf95b6d43eae9687/header.jpg?t=1772811309","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  M1 or Intel at 2 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Graphics 4400 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3703200/179240024/9f8c7c67272f7495958e0c945ef29c3e6e769d4c/1772368840/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772369420","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3703200/179240024/9f8c7c67272f7495958e0c945ef29c3e6e769d4c/1772368840/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772369420","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3703200/179240024/9f8c7c67272f7495958e0c945ef29c3e6e769d4c/1772368840/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772369420","id":257296250,"name":"PV2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257296250/71d0bf341cdf453c24fd6f7fb34559da9cf6e194/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772369420"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.